Association StudentProgramAssociation
    documentation 'This association represents the Program(s) that a student participates in or is 
	'served by.
    domain entity Student
        documentation 'The Student associated with the Program.
    domain entity Program
        documentation 'The Program associated with the Student.
        with context Program
    include Service
        documentation 'Indicates the Service(s) being provided to the Student by the Program.
        is optional collection
    date BeginDate
        documentation 'The month, day, and year on which the Student first received services.
        is part of identity
    date EndDate
        documentation 'The month, day, and year on which the Student exited the Program or stopped 
		'receiving services.
        is optional
    descriptor ReasonExited
        documentation 'The reason the child left the Program within a school or district.
        is optional
    reference EducationOrganization
        documentation 'The EducationOrganization where the Student is participating in or receiving 
		'the Program services.
        is part of identity
    bool ServedOutsideOfRegularSession
        documentation 'Indicates whether the Student received services during the summer session or 
		'between sessions.
        is optional

